  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic.\n• In a medium saucepan, heat the plant-based butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat. Cook sesame seeds and half the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil.\n• Add jasmine rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes.\n• TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don’t peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fee1713d196bd6e04b2/step-249ae300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, trim green beans and pea pods.\n• Roughly chop Asian greens.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fee1713d196bd6e04b2/step-05682c10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the rice has 10 minutes remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook pea pods and green beans, tossing, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add Asian greens and remaining garlic and cook until fragrant and wilted, 1 minute.\n• Transfer to a bowl, season to taste with salt and pepper and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fee1713d196bd6e04b2/step-51bcdd20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut Japanese tofu into quarters.\n• In a small bowl, combine ginger paste, teriyaki sauce and the water (for the sauce).\n• In a shallow bowl, combine tofu, cornflour and a pinch of salt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fee1713d196bd6e04b2/step-d7894d30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return the pan to medium-high heat with a generous drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, shake off excess cornflour and cook tofu, tossing, until golden, 3-4 minutes.\n• Stir in the sauce mixture and toss tofu to coat, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fee1713d196bd6e04b2/step-d3e45c40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide sesame rice and garlic greens between bowls.\n• Top with ginger teriyaki tofu. Spoon over any remaining sauce from the pan.\n• Sprinkle with crispy shallots to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fee1713d196bd6e04b2/step-a6d1bf50.jpg"
    }
  ]
